## Consent and Withdrawal

MoBa is a **consent-based study**, and participants may withdraw at any time.

Projects receive an `SV_INFO` file containing individuals with valid consent.

### Withdrawal rules

- **Mother withdraws** → entire pregnancy removed (all individuals)
- **Father withdraws** → only father removed
- **Child (≥18 years) withdraws** → entire pregnancy removed

📖 More information (Norwegian):  
https://www.fhi.no/op/studier/moba/deltakere/informasjonsbrev-om-reservasjonsrett/

