## Questionnaire Versions

MoBa questionnaires exist in multiple versions (A, B, C, …).

### Implications

- Differences in:
  - Question wording  
  - Response categories  
  - Variable definitions  

- Some variables:
  - Stored together (if identical)  
  - Stored separately (if substantially different)

### Additional variations

- Paper vs digital versions (W) for:
  - Q2 (diet)
  - Q6 (3 years)
  - Q7 (7 years)

📖 Documentation:
- [Questionnaires (FHI)](https://www.fhi.no/en/ch/studies/moba/for-forskere-artikler/questionnaires-from-moba/)
- Wiki: [Questionnaires](Questionnaires.md)

